{"3691190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FED Chairman", "steam_appid": 3691190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "[h1]Take the Chair. Steer the Economy.[/h1]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control monetary policy for the United States in a single-player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >macro-strategy simulator. Raise or cut rates, deploy QE/QT, face surprise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shocks, and watch every decision ripple through housing, jobs, and markets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board Briefing</strong> – Read daily data, headlines, and staff projections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliberate &amp; Vote</strong> – Adjust policy levers live in a simulated FOMC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the Ripple</strong> – Advance time; the dynamic model recalculates 60+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    indicators in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>React to Events </strong>– Oil embargoes, pandemics, debt-ceiling crises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Persist</strong> – Credibility, CPI, GDP, and unemployment feed an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    overall grade that unlocks new scenarios.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes at Launch</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> – 4 historical crises: 1929, 1973, 2008, 2020</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Missions </strong>– 30 missions to achieve</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ monetary tools: Fed Funds target, IOER, swap lines, standing repos, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiscal &amp; regulatory tools such as Tariffs and Taxes to control the economy inflation and unemployment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60-variable macro model with regional heat-map feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic control-room UI—flick levers, stamp minutes, slide dot plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions; all modes above included in base purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English (audio &amp; text)</p>", "about_the_game": "[h1]Take the Chair. Steer the Economy.[/h1]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control monetary policy for the United States in a single-player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >macro-strategy simulator. Raise or cut rates, deploy QE/QT, face surprise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shocks, and watch every decision ripple through housing, jobs, and markets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board Briefing</strong> – Read daily data, headlines, and staff projections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliberate &amp; Vote</strong> – Adjust policy levers live in a simulated FOMC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the Ripple</strong> – Advance time; the dynamic model recalculates 60+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    indicators in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>React to Events </strong>– Oil embargoes, pandemics, debt-ceiling crises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Persist</strong> – Credibility, CPI, GDP, and unemployment feed an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    overall grade that unlocks new scenarios.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes at Launch</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> – 4 historical crises: 1929, 1973, 2008, 2020</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Missions </strong>– 30 missions to achieve</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ monetary tools: Fed Funds target, IOER, swap lines, standing repos, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiscal &amp; regulatory tools such as Tariffs and Taxes to control the economy inflation and unemployment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60-variable macro model with regional heat-map feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic control-room UI—flick levers, stamp minutes, slide dot plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions; all modes above included in base purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English (audio &amp; text)</p>", "short_description": "Lead the U.S. economy: adjust rates, deploy QE/QT, and balance inflation with employment in this macro-strategy sim.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691190/eac601de2c209f37cd044590c5116a3fbad48745/header.jpg?t=1784235341", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691190/51d6e6212c951c8b13757356bcae3a590cd1264b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784235341", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691190/51d6e6212c951c8b13757356bcae3a590cd1264b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784235341", "website": "https://www.fedchairman.org/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<